## Features

- Support ref cleanup functions (#4436, thanks @marvinhagemeister)

This adds support for returning a function in functional refs, example

```jsx
<input
  ref={(ref) => {
    // Assign ref, do something with it
    return () => {
      // ref cleanup, when the element unmounts
