Good call on the tests, forgot to push mine, but I'm not quite sure I follow re:JSX rendering in particular? JSX will always go through `IntrinsicElements` which always specifies the event target type:

```ts
interface IntrinsicElements { 
    button: ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>;
